    <innerclass refid="class_lineal_decay" prot="public">LinealDecay</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the <ref refid="class_lineal_decay" kindref="compound">LinealDecay</ref> class which implements linear decay dynamics. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_lineal_decay" kindref="compound">LinealDecay</ref> models a linear decrease of a quantity over time. It is derived from the abstract <ref refid="class_decay" kindref="compound">Decay</ref> class and implements the apply method to reduce the value linearly based on a decay rate. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
